      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? that sounds super scary. i mean i was sitting for like 12 hours straight so it's probably just my muscles being stiff from the seat. plus i haven't drank much water since the flight, so it's likely just dehydration making me feel lightheaded. is there anything i can take for the pain or just drink some electrolytes to make it go away? i'm way too tired to deal with an er right now.",
